      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-accent uppercase">SECTION 06 · ANTI-RUNAWAY FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="w-faq-heading" class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-3xl">
        机场跑路鉴别、订阅防盗与主备容灾 10 大高频问答
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
